ext-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/10" href="/ar/services/paint-protection-dubai">العربية</a></div></div></div><nav id="floating-navigation" class="absolute right-0 top-[calc(100%+0.75rem)] w-[258px] max-w-[calc(100vw-1.5rem)] origin-top overflow-hidden rounded-[1.25rem] border p-2.5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-200 lg:left-1/2 lg:right-auto lg:-translate-x-1/2 border-white/10 bg-[#171922] text-white shadow-black/60 invisible -translate-y-2 scale-[0.98] opacity-0" aria-label="Main navigation"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1"><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/about">About Us</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/services">Services</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/brands">Brands</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/tuning">GAD</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/vrx">VRX</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/blog">Blog</a><a class="rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold opacity-75 transition-colors hover:opacity-100 hover:bg-white/[0.07]" href="/faq">FAQ</a></div><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%20DIGI-TEC%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20get%20in%20touch%20about%20my%20vehicle." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-burnt-orange px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-orange-600">Contact Us</a></nav></div><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%20DIGI-TEC%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20get%20in%20touch%20about%20my%20vehicle." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="pointer-events-auto hidden min-h-[52px] min-w-[156px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border px-6 text-sm font-semibold shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.16)] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-burnt-orange lg:flex border-transparent bg-[#171819] text-white hover:bg-[#202122]">Contact Us</a></div></header><div class="h-[98px] lg:h-[126px]"></div><main id="paint-protection-main"><section class="ph-hero theme-dark-section" aria-labelledby="protection-title"><div class="ph-hero-copy"><nav class="ph-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a href="/services">Services</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span aria-current="page">Car Paint Protection</span></nav><p class="ph-kicker">DIGI-TEC Performance Center / Al Quoz, Dubai</p><h1 id="protection-title">Car Paint Protection in Dubai</h1><p>Choose paint protection around the condition of your car and how you use it. Paint protection film adds a physical layer to covered panels. Ceramic coating treats the surface to support water behaviour and cleaning. Polishing and paint correction improve suitable existing defects before protection is considered.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%20DIGI-TEC%2C%20I%20would%20like%20a%20paint%20protection%20quote.%20Make%2Fmodel%2Fyear%3A%20Paint%20condition%20or%20previous%20repairs%3A%20Driving%20and%20parking%3A%20Preferred%20coverage%20or%20goal%3A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-placement="hero" class="ph-button ph-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg>Get a Paint Protection Quote</a><a href="tel:+97143402223" data-cta-placement="hero" class="ph-button ph-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>Call the Al Quoz workshop</a></div></div><figure><img src="/images/ppf/film-application-1200.webp" srcSet="/images/ppf/film-application-640.webp 640w, /images/ppf/film-application-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 46vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" fetchPriority="high" alt="Transparent film being smoothed over the bonnet of a white Porsche"/><figcaption>Film application photograph. Coverage and product are agreed for your vehicle.</figcaption></figure></section><nav class="ph-jump" aria-label="Paint protection sections"><a href="#protection-options">Paint Protection Options Available at DIGI-TEC</a><a href="#protection-comparison">PPF vs Ceramic Coating vs Paint Correction</a><a href="#protection-quote">Get a Paint Protection Quote</a></nav><section class="ph-section"><h2>Why Protect Your Car’s Paint in Dubai?</h2><p>Outdoor parking exposes paint to sunlight and weathering. Road debris can chip vulnerable panels, while dust trapped in wash materials can mark the finish. Bird droppings and other contaminants need appropriate removal. Decide whether your priority is a physical barrier, easier routine cleaning or improving existing paint marks; no treatment removes the need for careful washing.</p></section><section id="protection-options" class="ph-section ph-panel"><h2>Paint Protection Options Available at DIGI-TEC</h2><div class="ph-cards"><article><h3>Paint protection film (PPF)</h3><p>Film covers the agreed panels and can reduce some stone-chip damage and light abrasion. Choose coverage according to the exposed areas and your driving. It does not repair the paint beneath it.</p><a class="ph-link" href="/services/paint-protection-film">Explore PPF coverage and installation</a></article><article><h3>Ceramic coating</h3><p>A compatible coating can support water beading, appearance and easier cleaning on prepared surfaces. It does not provide the impact barrier of film or remove existing scratches.</p><a class="ph-link" href="/services/ceramic-coating">Explore ceramic coating and preparation</a></article><article id="paint-correction"><h3>Car polishing and paint correction</h3><p>Polishing improves gloss and safely correctable swirls or light defects. It removes a small amount of material when abrasive products are used. It does not add long-term protective coverage by itself.</p><a class="ph-link" href="/services/car-polishing-dubai">Assess polishing and paint correction</a></article></div></section><section id="protection-comparison" class="ph-section"><h2>PPF vs Ceramic Coating vs Paint Correction</h2><p>Compare the purpose first. Product performance, preparation and covered surfaces vary, so the quote should identify the chosen treatment and its limits.</p><div class="ph-table" role="region" aria-label="PPF vs Ceramic Coating vs Paint Correction" tabindex="0"><table><caption>PPF vs Ceramic Coating vs Paint Correction</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Consideration</th><th scope="col">Paint protection film</th><th scope="col">Ceramic coating</th><th scope="col">Polishing / correction</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Purpose</th><td>Physical film barrier on covered panels</td><td>Surface treatment for water behaviour and cleaning</td><td>Improve the appearance of suitable existing defects</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stone-chip resistance</th><td>Can reduce some chip damage; impacts may still damage film or paint</td><td>Does not provide a film barrier against stone chips</td><td>Does not prevent chips or replace missing paint</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Scratch resistance</th><td>May reduce light abrasion on covered panels; cuts and deeper damage remain possible</td><td>Does not make paint scratch-proof; careful washing matters</td><td>May improve shallow marks within safe paint limits</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">UV / weathering</th><td>Review the specific film’s performance and care requirements</td><td>Environmental resistance depends on the selected coating</td><td>Can improve suitable surface deterioration; adds no lasting weather barrier</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hydrophobic properties</th><td>Water behaviour varies by film; compatible coating is a separate decision</td><td>A hydrophobic product can encourage beading; spotting is still possible</td><td>Polishing alone does not provide durable water repellency</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maintenance</th><td>Gentle washing and product-specific edge care; inspect damage</td><td>Regular gentle washing, drying and product-specific aftercare</td><td>Gentle washing preserves the improved finish; assess new marks</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relative cost</th><td>Coverage and installation complexity drive cost; full coverage generally costs more than partial coverage</td><td>Preparation, product and treated surfaces drive cost; often less than extensive film coverage</td><td>Defect condition and correction scope drive cost; intensive preparation can be substantial</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Use cases</th><td>Prioritise vulnerable panels or wider physical coverage</td><td>Prioritise cleaning and finish care on suitable surfaces</td><td>Address existing swirls, haze or shallow defects before protection</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="ph-section ph-panel"><h2>Which Protection Is Right for Your Vehicle?</h2><ul class="ph-list"><li>Frequent road driving: discuss film for panels exposed to debris, with a written list of covered and excluded areas.</li><li>A sound finish and easier cleaning: discuss ceramic coating, preparation and the washing routine you can maintain.</li><li>Visible swirls or dull paint: assess polishing first. Deep scratches, missing paint or peeling clear coat may need a different repair.</li><li>Combined protection: discuss PPF and ceramic coating only where the film, coating and surface are compatible. Confirm application order and aftercare.</li></ul></section><section id="protection-process" class="ph-section"><h2>DIGI-TEC’s Paint Preparation and Protection Process</h2><ol class="ph-cards"><li><p class="ph-kicker">0<!-- -->1</p><h3>Inspect the finish</h3><p>Share your model, year, previous repairs, existing protection and concerns. Photos can start the discussion; paint suitability may require an inspection.</p></li><li><p class="ph-kicker">0<!-- -->2</p><h3>Agree preparation</h3><p>Confirm cleaning, contamination removal and any correction needed. A new car can still have marks; aggressive correction is not automatic.</p></li><li><p class="ph-kicker">0<!-- -->3</p><h3>Choose product and scope</h3><p>Document the film or coating, covered panels or surfaces, exclusions and the work required before approval.</p></li><li><p class="ph-kicker">0<!-- -->4</p><h3>Apply and hand over</h3><p>Installation or application follows the agreed product and surface requirements. Review the finish and obtain curing, first-wash and maintenance guidance.</p></li></ol></section><section class="ph-section ph-panel"><h2>Vehicle-Specific Protection Considerations</h2><p>Factory paint, repainted panels and existing film or coating need individual assessment. Matte and satin paint must not be treated like a gloss finish: polishing can change the appearance. Vehicle size, panel shape, edges and any previous work affect preparation and coverage. Product suitability is confirmed for the exact finish.</p><p>Explore our existing brand workshop pages, then discuss your vehicle’s paint:</p><nav class="ph-brands" aria-label="Brand workshop pages"><a href="/brands/mercedes-benz-service-dubai">Mercedes-Benz</a><a href="/brands/porsche-service-dubai">Porsche</a><a href="/brands/bmw-service-dubai">BMW</a><a href="/brands/lamborghini-service-dubai">Lamborghini</a><a href="/brands/ferrari-service-dubai">Ferrari</a><a href="/brands/rolls-royce-service-dubai">Rolls-Royce</a><a href="/brands/range-rover-service-dubai">Range Rover</a></nav></section><section class="ph-section"><h2>Maintenance and Aftercare</h2><p>Follow the selected product’s instructions for curing, the first wash and cleaning materials. Avoid wiping dry dust across the paint. Use clean wash materials and dry the surface carefully to reduce spotting. Promptly discuss lifted film edges, contamination or new marks with the workshop before abrasive polishing or reapplication.</p></section><section id="protection-faq" class="ph-section ph-panel"><h2>Paint Protection FAQs</h2><details><summary>What is the difference between PPF and ceramic coating?</summary><p>PPF is a physical film on the covered panels that can reduce some impact and abrasion damage. Ceramic coating treats a compatible surface to support water behaviour and cleaning. They serve different purposes and can be considered together when the products are compatible.</p></details><details><summary>Is polishing a form of paint protection?</summary><p>Polishing can improve gloss and safely correctable defects. It does not provide long-term protective coverage by itself. Discuss suitable film or coating after preparation if protection is your priority.</p></details><details><summary>Does a new car need paint correction first?</summary><p>Not automatically. Inspect the finish for delivery marks, contamination or prior work. The preparation should match the paint condition and agreed result, while preserving safely correctable paint layers.</p></details><details><summary>Can paint protection stop every scratch or stone chip?</summary><p>No. Film can reduce some damage on covered panels, but impacts, cuts or severe abrasion can still damage it or the paint. Ceramic coating does not provide the same physical barrier, and all finishes need careful maintenance.</p></details><details><summary>What determines a paint protection quote in Dubai?</summary><p>Vehicle size, paint condition, previous repairs, preparation, selected product and covered panels or surfaces affect the quote. Send the make, model, year and your priorities. No fixed price or product warranty is assumed before the scope is confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Can old or repainted panels be protected?</summary><p>Suitability depends on the finish, repair history, adhesion and product requirements. Discuss previous paintwork before installation or application. Missing paint, deep damage and unsound clear coat may need repair rather than protection alone.</p></details></section><section class="ph-section"><h2>Plan Your Paint Care</h2><nav class="ph-resources" aria-label="Plan Your Paint Care"><a href="/blog/ceramic-coating-vs-ppf-dubai">Read the ceramic coating and PPF comparison</a><a href="/blog/why-ceramic-coating-matters-uae">Read about ceramic coating preparation and care</a><a href="/services/car-body-repair-dubai">Assess body and paint repair for deeper damage</a></nav></section><section id="protection-quote" class="ph-section ph-panel"><h2>Request a Paint Protection Quote</h2><p>Send your make, model, year, paint condition and driving or parking priorities. Tell us whether you want film coverage, coating, correction or help choosing. Add photos in WhatsApp and mention previous paintwork. The team will discuss preparation, suitable coverage and the quote before work is agreed.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%20DIGI-TEC%2C%20I%20would%20like%20a%20paint%20protection%20quote.%20Make%2Fmodel%2Fyear%3A%20Paint%20condition%20or%20previous%20repairs%3A%20Driving%20and%20parking%3A%20Preferred%20coverage%20or%20goal%3A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-placement="service_details" class="ph-button ph-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg>Get a Paint Protection Quote</a><a href="tel:+97143402223" data-cta-placement="service_details" class="ph-button ph-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>Call the Al Quoz workshop</a></div><address>DIGI-TEC Performance Center<br/>Al Quoz Industrial Area 3, Dubai, UAE<br/><a href="tel:+97143402223" data-cta-placement="final_cta">+971 4 340 2223</a></address></section></main><footer class="border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0b0c0d] py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[90rem] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.8fr_1fr_1.1fr] xl:gap-12"><section aria-label="DIGI-TEC Performance Center"><a class="inline-block" href="/"><img src="/lovable-uploads/916789e0-b6fb-43d4-9d52-79899ce5a1c2.png" alt="DIGI-TEC Performance Center" width="429" height="49" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="h-9 w-auto brightness-110"/></a><p class="mt-6 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-white/45">Independent luxury and performance car workshop in Al Quoz, Dubai. Specialist diagnostics, repair, maintenance and performance upgrades since 2002.</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Al+Quoz+Industrial+Area+3+Dubai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange">Get directions to our workshop →</a></section><nav aria-label="Quick links"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-off-white">Quick Links</h2><div class="mt-5"><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/about">About Us</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/services">All Services</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/brands">Brands We Service</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/tuning">Performance Tuning</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/vrx">VRX</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/blog">Workshop Guides</a></div></nav><nav aria-label="Selected services"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-off-white">Popular Services</h2><div class="mt-5"><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/brands/mercedes-benz-service-dubai">Mercedes Repair</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/services/car-diagnostics-dubai">Diagnostics &amp; Programming</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/services/oil-change-dubai">Oil Change Service</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/services/transmission-repair-dubai">Transmission Repair</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/services/brake-repair-dubai">Brake Repair</a><a class="block py-1.5 text-sm text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/tuning">Performance Tuning</a></div></nav><section aria-label="Contact"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-off-white">Contact</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-sm leading-6 text-white/45"><p><span class="block font-semibold text-off-white">Dubai Workshop</span>Warehouses 11–15, Al Quoz Industrial Area 3<br/>Dubai, UAE</p><p><a href="tel:+97143402223" class="font-semibold text-off-white transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange">+971 4 340 2223</a><br/><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b2dbdcd4ddf2d6dbd5dbc6d7d1dfd79cd1dddf" class="transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="98f1f6fef7d8fcf1fff1ecfdfbf5fdb6fbf7f5">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></div><div class="mt-5 flex gap-3" aria-label="Social media"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/digi_tec/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs font-semibold text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" aria-label="DIGI-TEC on Instagram">Instagram</a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Digitecme/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs font-semibold text-white/45 transition-colors hover:text-white" aria-label="DIGI-TEC on Facebook">Facebook</a></div></section></div><div class="mt-14 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/[0.08] pt-7 text-xs text-white/30 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><p>© 2026 <span class="text-burnt-orange">D</span>IGI-TEC Performance Center. All rights reserved.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><a class="transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/faq">FAQ</a><a class="transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange" href="/sitemap">Sitemap</a><a href="/privacy-policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors hover:text-burnt-orange">Privacy Policy</a></div></div></div></footer><nav class="ph-mobile" aria-label="Paint protection contact shortcuts"><a href="https://wa.me/97143402223?text=Hi%20DIGI-TEC%2C%20I%20would%20like%20a%20paint%20protection%20quote.%20Make%2Fmodel%2Fyear%3A%20Paint%20condition%20or%20previous%20repairs%3A%20Driving%20and%20parking%3A%20Preferred%20coverage%20or%20goal%3A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta-placement="paint_protection_mobile" class="ph-button ph-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path></svg>Get a Paint Protection Quote</a><a href="tel:+97143402223" data-cta-placement="paint_protection_mobile" class="ph-button ph-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>Call the Al Quoz workshop</a></nav></div><!--/$--></div>
